<title>USA: Telechips names interim CEO.</title>
<headline>Telechips names interim CEO.</headline>
<dateline>RENO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telechips Corp said Thursday that Nelson Caldwell had been appointed acting president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>It also said its board had proposed a one-for-15 reverse stock split.</p>
<p>The board is conducting a search for a new president and chief executive officer, it said.</p>
<p>Caldwell, 40, the company's vice president-finance and secretary since May 1995, remains chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The board authorized a special meeting of shareholders March 5 for the purpose of effecting the reverse split.</p>
</text>
